item.glider:glider=Wind Glider
pack.name=Wind Glider – Behavior
pack.description=Short hop: press Jump again within 0.4s to open. Long fall: after 0.8s press Jump once to open. Press Jump again to close. After a wall impact, reopen only after landing. An open glider gains lift over fire, lit campfires and exposed lava. Four lift zones per height band, then a 10s pause. A source 10 blocks above the first starts a new band.
